# UI / UX rules

Read before any visual or screen work (in order):

1. `spec/01-visual-direction.md`
2. `spec/02-design-system-rules.md`
3. `spec/03-page-layout-guidelines.md`
4. `spec/04-ai-aesthetic-guardrails.md` — pass the aesthetic QA checklist

## Non-negotiable

- Content-first hierarchy; subtle chrome.
- Neutral warm palette (`apps/frontend/theme/colors.ts` aligns with spec).
- No generic SaaS patterns or loud accent CTAs by default.
- Map screens to layout patterns in `03` (Landing, List, Detail, Form, etc.).

Document which specs were applied and any deviation in the change description.
